WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — ai-reads-human (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.354
<v Narrator>Ọkan, awọn kọmputa nigbagbogbo yipada data ni awọn ọna kika ọrọ ti a kọ fun awọn oju eniyan, n fa awọn ẹrọ lati lo iṣẹ afikun.

2
00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:18.950
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ọrọ miiran, o jẹ ki a mọ pe awọn nọmba meji ti o ni ibatan si awọn nọmba mẹta ti o wa ni apapọ.

3
00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:26.890
<v Narrator>Ninu ọrọ kan, awọn ohun elo ti o ni agbara diẹ sii ju awọn ohun elo 12 lọ le ṣe iyatọ si ara wọn.
